<title>USA: BASEBALL-FULL ROSTERS FOR THE NEXT WEEK'S ALL-STAR GAME.</title>
<headline>BASEBALL-FULL ROSTERS FOR THE NEXT WEEK'S ALL-STAR GAME.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rosters for next Tuesday's</p>
<p>major league All-Star Game at Jacobs Field in Cleveland,</p>
<p>following the naming of pitchers and reserves by the All-Star</p>
<p>managers on Wednesday:</p>
<p>			   NATIONAL LEAGUE</p>
<p>Starters</p>
<p>Catcher - Mike Piazza, Los Angeles Dodgers</p>
<p>First Base - Jeff Bagwell, Houston Astros</p>
<p>Second Base - Craig Biggio, Houston Astros</p>
<p>Shortstop - Barry Larkin, Cincinnati Reds</p>
<p>Third Base - Ken Caminiti, San Diego Padres</p>
<p>Outfield - Kenny Lofton, Atlanta Braves</p>
<p>Outfield - Larry Walker, Colorado Rockies</p>
<p>Outfield - Tony Gwynn, San Diego Padres</p>
<p>Reserves</p>
<p> Catchers    - Todd Hundley, New York Mets</p>
<p>		   Javier Lopez, Atlanta Braves</p>
<p>Infielders  - Jeff Blauser, Atlanta Braves, SS</p>
<p>		   Andres Galarraga, Colorado Rockies, 1B</p>
<p>		   Mark Grace, Chicago Cubs, 1B</p>
<p>		   Chipper Jones, Atlanta Braves, 3B</p>
<p>		   Tony Womack, Pittsburgh Pirates, 2B</p>
<p>Outfielders - Moises Alou, Florida Marlins</p>
<p>		   Barry Bonds, San Francisco Giants</p>
<p>		   Ray Lankford, St. Louis Cardinals</p>
<p>Pitchers</p>
<p>Tom Glavine, Atlanta Braves</p>
<p>Greg Maddux, Atlanta Braves</p>
<p>Denny Neagle, Atlanta Braves</p>
<p>Kevin Brown, Florida Marlins</p>
<p>Darryl Kile, Houston Astros</p>
<p>Pedro Martinez, Montreal Expos</p>
<p>Bobby Jones, New York Mets</p>
<p>Curt Schilling, Philadelphia Phillies</p>
<p>Rod Beck, San Francisco Giants</p>
<p>Shawn Estes, San Francisco Giants</p>
<p>			   AMERICAN LEAGUE</p>
<p>Starters</p>
<p>Catcher - Ivan Rodriguez, Texas Rangers</p>
<p>First Base - Tino Martinez, New York Yankees</p>
<p>Second Base - Roberto Alomar, Baltimore Orioles</p>
<p>Shortstop - Alex Rodriguez, Seattle Mariners</p>
<p>Third Base - Cal Ripken, Baltimore Orioles</p>
<p>Outfield - Ken Griffey Junior, Seattle Mariners</p>
<p>Outfield - David Justice, Cleveland Indians</p>
<p>Outfield - Brady Anderson, Baltimore Orioles</p>
<p>Designated Hitter - Edgar Martinez, Seattle Mariners</p>
<p>Reserves</p>
<p> Catchers    - Sandy Alomar, Cleveland Indians</p>
<p>Infielders  - Jeff Cirillo, Milwaukee, 3B</p>
<p>		   Joey Cora, Seattle Mariners, 2B</p>
<p>		   Nomar Garciaparra, Boston Red Sox, SS</p>
<p>		   Chuck Knoblauch, Minnesota Twins, 2B</p>
<p>		   Mark McGwire, Oakland Athletics, 1B</p>
<p>		   Frank Thomas, Chicago White Sox, 1B</p>
<p>Outfielders - Albert Belle, Chicago White Sox</p>
<p>		   Bernie Williams, New York Yankees</p>
<p>Pitchers</p>
<p>Jason Dickson, Anaheim Angels</p>
<p>Jimmy Key, Baltimore Orioles (X)</p>
<p>Mike Mussina, Baltimore Orioles</p>
<p>Randy Myers, Baltimore Orioles</p>
<p>Justin Thompson, Detroit Tigers</p>
<p>Jose Rosada, Kansas City Royals</p>
<p>David Cone, New York Yankees</p>
<p>Mariano Rivera, New York Yankees</p>
<p>Randy Johnson, Seattle Mariners</p>
<p>Roger Clemens, Toronto Blue Jays</p>
<p>Pat Hentgen, Toronto Blue Jays</p>
<p>(X) - Invited to team but declined invitation</p>
